                <mxCell id="title" value="nexus-flow — High-Level Architecture" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=25;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#1C1C1C;fontFamily=Merriweather;fontSource=https%3A%2F%2Ffonts.googleapis.com%2Fcss%3Ffamily%3DMerriweather%3A700%2C900;" parent="1" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="40" y="2" width="700" height="36" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="A" value="1 · Who talks to the system" style="swimlane;html=1;startSize=32;fillColor=#E5E5E0;swimlaneFillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#E5E5E0;fontColor=#1C1C1C;fontSize=16;fontStyle=1;align=left;spacingLeft=14;collapsible=0;fontFamily=Merriweather;fontSource=https%3A%2F%2Ffonts.googleapis.com%2Fcss%3Ffamily%3DMerriweather%3A700%2C900;" parent="1" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="40" y="44" width="1200" height="120" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="A1" value="&lt;b&gt;Coding agent&lt;/b&gt; (Claude Code et al.)&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#6B6B6B&quot;&gt;one SessionStart hook per active block, then the verbs&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#E5E5E0;fontColor=#1C1C1C;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Merriweather Sans;fontSource=https%3A%2F%2Ffonts.googleapis.com%2Fcss%3Ffamily%3DMerriweather%2BSans%3A300%2C400%2C700;" parent="A" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="14" y="44" width="282" height="62" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="A2" value="&lt;b&gt;Human at the terminal&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#6B6B6B&quot;&gt;same verbs, different rendering&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#E5E5E0;fontColor=#1C1C1C;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Merriweather Sans;fontSource=https%3A%2F%2Ffonts.googleapis.com%2Fcss%3Ffamily%3DMerriweather%2BSans%3A300%2C400%2C700;" parent="A" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="310" y="44" width="282" height="62" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="A3" value="&lt;b&gt;MCP host&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#6B6B6B&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: JetBrains Mono, monospace; background-color: #F5FFE6; color: #1C1C1C; border-radius: 3px; padding: 0px 3px&quot;&gt;nxs mcp serve&lt;/span&gt; (stdio)&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#E5E5E0;fontColor=#1C1C1C;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Merriweather Sans;fontSource=https%3A%2F%2Ffonts.googleapis.com%2Fcss%3Ffamily%3DMerriweather%2BSans%3A300%2C400%2C700;" parent="A" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="606" y="44" width="282" height="62" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="A4" value="&lt;b&gt;Embedding apps&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#6B6B6B&quot;&gt;manufakt.io · nexflow.it (Tauri)&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#E5E5E0;fontColor=#1C1C1C;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Merriweather Sans;fontSource=https%3A%2F%2Ffonts.googleapis.com%2Fcss%3Ffamily%3DMerriweather%2BSans%3A300%2C400%2C700;" parent="A" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="902" y="44" width="282" height="62" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="B" value="2 · Surfaces — what you can &lt;i&gt;talk to&lt;/i&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot; color=&quot;#6B6B6B&quot;&gt;the CLI personas and the MCP server · thin callers, no model of their own&lt;/font&gt;" style="swimlane;html=1;startSize=32;fillColor=#E5E5E0;swimlaneFillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#E5E5E0;fontColor=#1C1C1C;fontSize=16;fontStyle=1;align=left;spacingLeft=14;collapsible=0;fontFamily=Merriweather;fontSource=https%3A%2F%2Ffonts.googleapis.com%2Fcss%3Ffamily%3DMerriweather%3A700%2C900;" parent="1" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="40" y="191" width="1200" height="232" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="B0" value="&lt;b&gt;crates/nxs&lt;/b&gt; — the composition root: &lt;b&gt;ONE binary&lt;/b&gt; on disk. &lt;span style=&quot;font-family: JetBrains Mono, monospace; background-color: #F5FFE6; color: #1C1C1C; border-radius: 3px; padding: 0px 3px&quot;&gt;nxf&lt;/span&gt; / &lt;span style=&quot;font-family: JetBrains Mono, monospace; background-color: #F5FFE6; color: #1C1C1C; border-radius: 3px; padding: 0px 3px&quot;&gt;nxm&lt;/span&gt; / &lt;span style=&quot;font-family: JetBrains Mono, monospace; background-color: #F5FFE6; color: #1C1C1C; border-radius: 3px; padding: 0px 3px&quot;&gt;nxc&lt;/span&gt; are symlinks to it, dispatched by &lt;span style=&quot;font-family: JetBrains Mono, monospace; background-color: #F5FFE6; color: #1C1C1C; border-radius: 3px; padding: 0px 3px&quot;&gt;argv[0]&lt;/span&gt;.&lt;br&gt;flow&#39;s surface is a crate of its own (&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: JetBrains Mono, monospace; background-color: #F5FFE6; color: #1C1C1C; border-radius: 3px; padding: 0px 3px&quot;&gt;crates/cli&lt;/span&gt;); memory&#39;s and chat&#39;s live inside their module crate." style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#E5E5E0;dashed=1;verticalAlign=top;align=left;spacingLeft=12;spacingTop=6;fontColor=#6B6B6B;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Merriweather Sans;fontSource=https%3A%2F%2Ffonts.googleapis.com%2Fcss%3Ffamily%3DMerriweather%2BSans%3A300%2C400%2C700;" vertex="1" parent="B">
                    <mxGeometry x="14" y="42" width="1172" height="177" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="B1" value="&lt;b&gt;nxs&lt;/b&gt; — the umbrella persona&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;font color=&quot;#6B6B6B&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: JetBrains Mono, monospace; background-color: #F5FFE6; color: #1C1C1C; border-radius: 3px; padding: 0px 3px&quot;&gt;init&lt;/span&gt; · &lt;span style=&quot;font-family: JetBrains Mono, monospace; background-color: #F5FFE6; color: #1C1C1C; border-radius: 3px; padding: 0px 3px&quot;&gt;prime&lt;/span&gt; · &lt;span style=&quot;font-family: JetBrains Mono, monospace; background-color: #F5FFE6; color: #1C1C1C; border-radius: 3px; padding: 0px 3px&quot;&gt;doctor&lt;/span&gt; · &lt;span style=&quot;font-family: JetBrains Mono, monospace; background-color: #F5FFE6; color: #1C1C1C; border-radius: 3px; padding: 0px 3px&quot;&gt;status&lt;/span&gt; · &lt;span style=&quot;font-family: JetBrains Mono, monospace; background-color: #F5FFE6; color: #1C1C1C; border-radius: 3px; padding: 0px 3px&quot;&gt;migrate&lt;/span&gt; · &lt;span style=&quot;font-family: JetBrains Mono, monospace; background-color: #F5FFE6; color: #1C1C1C; border-radius: 3px; padding: 0px 3px&quot;&gt;sync&lt;/span&gt; · &lt;span style=&quot;font-family: JetBrains Mono, monospace; background-color: #F5FFE6; color: #1C1C1C; border-radius: 3px; padding: 0px 3px&quot;&gt;self-update&lt;/span&gt; · &lt;span style=&quot;font-family: JetBrains Mono, monospace; background-color: #F5FFE6; color: #1C1C1C; border-radius: 3px; padding: 0px 3px&quot;&gt;mcp serve&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#E5E5E0;fontColor=#1C1C1C;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Merriweather Sans;fontSource=https%3A%2F%2Ffonts.googleapis.com%2Fcss%3Ffamily%3DMerriweather%2BSans%3A300%2C400%2C700;" parent="B" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="28" y="97" width="1144" height="46" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="B2" value="&lt;b&gt;nxf&lt;/b&gt; — the flow surface&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#6B6B6B&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: JetBrains Mono, monospace; background-color: #F5FFE6; color: #1C1C1C; border-radius: 3px; padding: 0px 3px&quot;&gt;crates/cli&lt;/span&gt; (lib-only)&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#E5E5E0;fontColor=#1C1C1C;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Merriweather Sans;fontSource=https%3A%2F%2Ffonts.googleapis.com%2Fcss%3Ffamily%3DMerriweather%2BSans%3A300%2C400%2C700;" parent="B" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="84" y="157" width="240" height="52" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="B3" value="&lt;b&gt;nxm&lt;/b&gt; — the memory surface&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#6B6B6B&quot;&gt;inside &lt;span style=&quot;font-family: JetBrains Mono, monospace; background-color: #F5FFE6; color: #1C1C1C; border-radius: 3px; padding: 0px 3px&quot;&gt;crates/memory&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#E5E5E0;fontColor=#1C1C1C;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Merriweather Sans;fontSource=https%3A%2F%2Ffonts.googleapis.com%2Fcss%3Ffamily%3DMerriweather%2BSans%3A300%2C400%2C700;" parent="B" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="479" y="157" width="240" height="52" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="B4" value="&lt;b&gt;nxc&lt;/b&gt; — the chat surface&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#6B6B6B&quot;&gt;inside &lt;span style=&quot;font-family: JetBrains Mono, monospace; background-color: #F5FFE6; color: #1C1C1C; border-radius: 3px; padding: 0px 3px&quot;&gt;crates/chat&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#E5E5E0;fontColor=#1C1C1C;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Merriweather Sans;fontSource=https%3A%2F%2Ffonts.googleapis.com%2Fcss%3Ffamily%3DMerriweather%2BSans%3A300%2C400%2C700;" parent="B" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="875" y="157" width="240" height="52" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="C" value="3 · Engines — what &lt;i&gt;holds the model&lt;/i&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot; color=&quot;#6B6B6B&quot;&gt;every surface above is a thin caller of this layer — and an app links it directly, which is why CLI coverage never proves the engine seam&lt;/font&gt;" style="swimlane;html=1;startSize=32;fillColor=#E5E5E0;swimlaneFillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#E5E5E0;fontColor=#1C1C1C;fontSize=16;fontStyle=1;align=left;spacingLeft=14;collapsible=0;fontFamily=Merriweather;fontSource=https%3A%2F%2Ffonts.googleapis.com%2Fcss%3Ffamily%3DMerriweather%3A700%2C900;" parent="1" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="40" y="462" width="1200" height="203" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="C1" value="&lt;b&gt;flow&lt;/b&gt; — projects, tasks, dependencies&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#6B6B6B&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: JetBrains Mono, monospace; background-color: #F5FFE6; color: #1C1C1C; border-radius: 3px; padding: 0px 3px&quot;&gt;crates/core&lt;/span&gt; — items, edges, notes; ready / blocked / next&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Plugins (issue-tracker · personal-todo · consumer-owned) register here at &lt;b&gt;compile time&lt;/b&gt; via &lt;span style=&quot;font-family: JetBrains Mono, monospace; background-color: #F5FFE6; color: #1C1C1C; border-radius: 3px; padding: 0px 3px&quot;&gt;inventory&lt;/span&gt;.&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#E5E5E0;align=left;spacingLeft=10;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=6;fontColor=#1C1C1C;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Merriweather Sans;fontSource=https%3A%2F%2Ffonts.googleapis.com%2Fcss%3Ffamily%3DMerriweather%2BSans%3A300%2C400%2C700;" parent="C" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="14" y="44" width="381" height="148" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="C1s" value="&lt;b&gt;engine seam&lt;font color=&quot;#1c1c1c&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: JetBrains Mono, monospace; background-color: #FFFFFF; color: #1C1C1C; border: 1px solid #DCEFC0; border-radius: 3px; padding: 0px 3px&quot;&gt;crates/facade&lt;/span&gt; · &lt;i&gt;the only SemVer contract with a gate&lt;/i&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F5FFE6;strokeColor=#84CC16;fontColor=#1C1C1C;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Merriweather Sans;fontSource=https%3A%2F%2Ffonts.googleapis.com%2Fcss%3Ffamily%3DMerriweather%2BSans%3A300%2C400%2C700;" vertex="1" parent="C1">
                    <mxGeometry x="10" y="97" width="361" height="42" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="C2" value="&lt;b&gt;memory&lt;/b&gt; — durable project knowledge&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#6B6B6B&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: JetBrains Mono, monospace; background-color: #F5FFE6; color: #1C1C1C; border-radius: 3px; padding: 0px 3px&quot;&gt;crates/memory&lt;/span&gt; (nexus-memory)&lt;br&gt;its own &lt;span style=&quot;font-family: JetBrains Mono, monospace; background-color: #F5FFE6; color: #1C1C1C; border-radius: 3px; padding: 0px 3px&quot;&gt;fact&lt;/span&gt; op-log over the same substrate&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#E5E5E0;align=left;spacingLeft=10;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=6;fontColor=#1C1C1C;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Merriweather Sans;fontSource=https%3A%2F%2Ffonts.googleapis.com%2Fcss%3Ffamily%3DMerriweather%2BSans%3A300%2C400%2C700;" parent="C" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="409" y="44" width="381" height="148" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="C2s" value="&lt;b&gt;engine seam&lt;font color=&quot;#1c1c1c&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: JetBrains Mono, monospace; background-color: #FFFFFF; color: #1C1C1C; border: 1px solid #DCEFC0; border-radius: 3px; padding: 0px 3px&quot;&gt;nexus_memory::Engine&lt;/span&gt; · &lt;i&gt;no SemVer gate yet&lt;/i&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F5FFE6;strokeColor=#84CC16;fontColor=#1C1C1C;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Merriweather Sans;fontSource=https%3A%2F%2Ffonts.googleapis.com%2Fcss%3Ffamily%3DMerriweather%2BSans%3A300%2C400%2C700;" vertex="1" parent="C2">
                    <mxGeometry x="10" y="97" width="361" height="42" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="C3" value="&lt;b&gt;chat&lt;/b&gt; — agent-to-agent coordination&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#6B6B6B&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: JetBrains Mono, monospace; background-color: #F5FFE6; color: #1C1C1C; border-radius: 3px; padding: 0px 3px&quot;&gt;crates/chat&lt;/span&gt; (nexus-chat)&lt;br&gt;agent sidecar &lt;b&gt;compiled into the binary&lt;/b&gt; (build.rs)&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#E5E5E0;align=left;spacingLeft=10;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=6;fontColor=#1C1C1C;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Merriweather Sans;fontSource=https%3A%2F%2Ffonts.googleapis.com%2Fcss%3Ffamily%3DMerriweather%2BSans%3A300%2C400%2C700;" parent="C" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="804" y="44" width="382" height="148" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="C3s" value="&lt;b&gt;engine seam&lt;font color=&quot;#1c1c1c&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: JetBrains Mono, monospace; background-color: #FFFFFF; color: #1C1C1C; border: 1px solid #DCEFC0; border-radius: 3px; padding: 0px 3px&quot;&gt;nexus_chat::Engine&lt;/span&gt; · &lt;i&gt;no SemVer gate yet&lt;/i&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F5FFE6;strokeColor=#84CC16;fontColor=#1C1C1C;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Merriweather Sans;fontSource=https%3A%2F%2Ffonts.googleapis.com%2Fcss%3Ffamily%3DMerriweather%2BSans%3A300%2C400%2C700;" vertex="1" parent="C3">
                    <mxGeometry x="10" y="97" width="362" height="42" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="D" value="4 · Substrate — ONE workspace, ONE op-log&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot; color=&quot;#6B6B6B&quot;&gt;(&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: JetBrains Mono, monospace; background-color: #FFFFFF; color: #1C1C1C; border: 1px solid #DCEFC0; border-radius: 3px; padding: 0px 3px&quot;&gt;.nxs/db.sqlite&lt;/span&gt; — git-ignored and device-local)&lt;/font&gt;" style="swimlane;html=1;startSize=32;fillColor=#F5FFE6;swimlaneFillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#84CC16;fontColor=#1C1C1C;fontSize=16;fontStyle=1;align=left;spacingLeft=14;collapsible=0;fontFamily=Merriweather;fontSource=https%3A%2F%2Ffonts.googleapis.com%2Fcss%3Ffamily%3DMerriweather%3A700%2C900;" parent="1" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="40" y="697" width="1200" height="150" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="D1" value="&lt;b&gt;nxs-foundation&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#6B6B6B&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: JetBrains Mono, monospace; background-color: #F5FFE6; color: #1C1C1C; border-radius: 3px; padding: 0px 3px&quot;&gt;Op&lt;/span&gt; · &lt;span style=&quot;font-family: JetBrains Mono, monospace; background-color: #F5FFE6; color: #1C1C1C; border-radius: 3px; padding: 0px 3px&quot;&gt;Store&lt;/span&gt; · the &lt;span style=&quot;font-family: JetBrains Mono, monospace; background-color: #F5FFE6; color: #1C1C1C; border-radius: 3px; padding: 0px 3px&quot;&gt;Reducer&lt;/span&gt; trait&lt;br&gt;workspace resolution, schema spine&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#E5E5E0;align=left;spacingLeft=10;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=6;fontColor=#1C1C1C;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Merriweather Sans;fontSource=https%3A%2F%2Ffonts.googleapis.com%2Fcss%3Ffamily%3DMerriweather%2BSans%3A300%2C400%2C700;" parent="D" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="14" y="44" width="285" height="92" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="D2" value="&lt;b&gt;ops&lt;/b&gt; — append-only&lt;br&gt;&lt;i&gt;the single source of truth&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#6B6B6B&quot;&gt;CRDT: LWW + OR-set + tombstones&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#B9FF66;strokeColor=#84CC16;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#1C1C1C;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Merriweather Sans;fontSource=https%3A%2F%2Ffonts.googleapis.com%2Fcss%3Ffamily%3DMerriweather%2BSans%3A300%2C400%2C700;" parent="D" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="409" y="44" width="266" height="92" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="D3" value="&lt;b&gt;materialized views&lt;/b&gt; — one fold per module&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#6B6B6B&quot;&gt;items · edges · notes&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;|&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;memories&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;|&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;messages · threads · channels&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Derivation (&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: JetBrains Mono, monospace; background-color: #F5FFE6; color: #1C1C1C; border-radius: 3px; padding: 0px 3px&quot;&gt;ready&lt;/span&gt; / &lt;span style=&quot;font-family: JetBrains Mono, monospace; background-color: #F5FFE6; color: #1C1C1C; border-radius: 3px; padding: 0px 3px&quot;&gt;blocked&lt;/span&gt; / &lt;span style=&quot;font-family: JetBrains Mono, monospace; background-color: #F5FFE6; color: #1C1C1C; border-radius: 3px; padding: 0px 3px&quot;&gt;next&lt;/span&gt;) is pure SQL over these views — never stored state.&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#E5E5E0;align=left;spacingLeft=10;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=6;fontColor=#1C1C1C;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Merriweather Sans;fontSource=https%3A%2F%2Ffonts.googleapis.com%2Fcss%3Ffamily%3DMerriweather%2BSans%3A300%2C400%2C700;" parent="D" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="774" y="44" width="412" height="92" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="E" value="5 · The outward edge — sync (offline-first)" style="swimlane;html=1;startSize=32;fillColor=#E5E5E0;swimlaneFillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#E5E5E0;fontColor=#1C1C1C;fontSize=16;fontStyle=1;align=left;spacingLeft=14;collapsible=0;fontFamily=Merriweather;fontSource=https%3A%2F%2Ffonts.googleapis.com%2Fcss%3Ffamily%3DMerriweather%3A700%2C900;" parent="1" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="40" y="885" width="1200" height="254" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="E1" value="&lt;b&gt;crates/sync&lt;/b&gt; (nxs-sync)&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#6B6B6B&quot;&gt;WireOp envelope + protocol DTOs&lt;br&gt;anti-entropy engine (&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: JetBrains Mono, monospace; background-color: #F5FFE6; color: #1C1C1C; border-radius: 3px; padding: 0px 3px&quot;&gt;engine&lt;/span&gt; feature)&lt;br&gt;&lt;i&gt;push: local-origin ops only · pull: from the cursor&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#E5E5E0;align=left;spacingLeft=10;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=6;fontColor=#1C1C1C;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Merriweather Sans;fontSource=https%3A%2F%2Ffonts.googleapis.com%2Fcss%3Ffamily%3DMerriweather%2BSans%3A300%2C400%2C700;" parent="E" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="14" y="44" width="350" height="94" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="E2" value="&lt;b&gt;Background service&lt;/b&gt; — &lt;span style=&quot;font-family: JetBrains Mono, monospace; background-color: #F5FFE6; color: #1C1C1C; border-radius: 3px; padding: 0px 3px&quot;&gt;crates/service&lt;/span&gt; + &lt;span style=&quot;font-family: JetBrains Mono, monospace; background-color: #F5FFE6; color: #1C1C1C; border-radius: 3px; padding: 0px 3px&quot;&gt;nxs sync daemon&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#6B6B6B&quot;&gt;one process per instance, registry &lt;span style=&quot;font-family: JetBrains Mono, monospace; background-color: #F5FFE6; color: #1C1C1C; border-radius: 3px; padding: 0px 3px&quot;&gt;~/.nexusflow/workspaces.toml&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#E5E5E0;align=left;spacingLeft=10;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=6;fontColor=#1C1C1C;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Merriweather Sans;fontSource=https%3A%2F%2Ffonts.googleapis.com%2Fcss%3Ffamily%3DMerriweather%2BSans%3A300%2C400%2C700;" parent="E" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="14" y="158" width="350" height="81" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="E3" value="&lt;b&gt;nxf-relay&lt;/b&gt; (crates/server)&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#6B6B6B&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;a dumb, durable op carrier&lt;/i&gt; — no fold, no derive, no validate&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: JetBrains Mono, monospace; background-color: #F5FFE6; color: #1C1C1C; border-radius: 3px; padding: 0px 3px&quot;&gt;OpStore&lt;/span&gt; + &lt;span style=&quot;font-family: JetBrains Mono, monospace; background-color: #F5FFE6; color: #1C1C1C; border-radius: 3px; padding: 0px 3px&quot;&gt;PrefixRegistry&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#E5E5E0;align=left;spacingLeft=10;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=6;fontColor=#1C1C1C;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Merriweather Sans;fontSource=https%3A%2F%2Ffonts.googleapis.com%2Fcss%3Ffamily%3DMerriweather%2BSans%3A300%2C400%2C700;" parent="E" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="434" y="44" width="350" height="94" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="E4" value="&lt;font color=&quot;#6B6B6B&quot;&gt;Backends: &lt;b&gt;SQLite&lt;/b&gt; · &lt;b&gt;Postgres&lt;/b&gt; (both shipped)&lt;br&gt;DynamoDB (supported source build)&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#E5E5E0;align=left;spacingLeft=10;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=6;fontColor=#1C1C1C;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Merriweather Sans;fontSource=https%3A%2F%2Ffonts.googleapis.com%2Fcss%3Ffamily%3DMerriweather%2BSans%3A300%2C400%2C700;" parent="E" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="434" y="158" width="350" height="81" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="E5" value="&lt;b&gt;Other replicas&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#6B6B6B&quot;&gt;another device · another app · another workspace&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;They converge over the same stream — the server is the durable truth, not the machine.&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#E5E5E0;dashed=1;align=left;spacingLeft=10;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=6;fontColor=#1C1C1C;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Merriweather Sans;fontSource=https%3A%2F%2Ffonts.googleapis.com%2Fcss%3Ffamily%3DMerriweather%2BSans%3A300%2C400%2C700;" parent="E" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="854" y="44" width="332" height="195" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="F" value="Cross-cutting (carries every band)" style="swimlane;html=1;startSize=32;fillColor=#E5E5E0;swimlaneFillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#E5E5E0;fontColor=#1C1C1C;fontSize=16;fontStyle=1;align=left;spacingLeft=14;collapsible=0;fontFamily=Merriweather;fontSource=https%3A%2F%2Ffonts.googleapis.com%2Fcss%3Ffamily%3DMerriweather%3A700%2C900;" parent="1" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="1350" y="44" width="390" height="700" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="F1" value="&lt;b&gt;nxs-init&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#6B6B6B&quot;&gt;self-registration via &lt;span style=&quot;font-family: JetBrains Mono, monospace; background-color: #F5FFE6; color: #1C1C1C; border-radius: 3px; padding: 0px 3px&quot;&gt;inventory&lt;/span&gt;: the roster &lt;span style=&quot;font-family: JetBrains Mono, monospace; background-color: #F5FFE6; color: #1C1C1C; border-radius: 3px; padding: 0px 3px&quot;&gt;nxs init&lt;/span&gt; / &lt;span style=&quot;font-family: JetBrains Mono, monospace; background-color: #F5FFE6; color: #1C1C1C; border-radius: 3px; padding: 0px 3px&quot;&gt;prime&lt;/span&gt; read. Assembler of the shared agent files.&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#E5E5E0;align=left;spacingLeft=10;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=6;fontColor=#1C1C1C;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Merriweather Sans;fontSource=https%3A%2F%2Ffonts.googleapis.com%2Fcss%3Ffamily%3DMerriweather%2BSans%3A300%2C400%2C700;" parent="F" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="14" y="44" width="362" height="76" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="F2" value="&lt;b&gt;nxs-ui&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#6B6B6B&quot;&gt;the shared presentation layer: colour ramp, chooser, TTY gating.&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#E5E5E0;align=left;spacingLeft=10;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=6;fontColor=#1C1C1C;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Merriweather Sans;fontSource=https%3A%2F%2Ffonts.googleapis.com%2Fcss%3Ffamily%3DMerriweather%2BSans%3A300%2C400%2C700;" parent="F" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="14" y="132" width="362" height="62" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="F3" value="&lt;b&gt;nxs-guide&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#6B6B6B&quot;&gt;ONE guide mechanism. Every building block ships its own &lt;span style=&quot;font-family: JetBrains Mono, monospace; background-color: #F5FFE6; color: #1C1C1C; border-radius: 3px; padding: 0px 3px&quot;&gt;docs/guide/{en,de}&lt;/span&gt; via &lt;span style=&quot;font-family: JetBrains Mono, monospace; background-color: #F5FFE6; color: #1C1C1C; border-radius: 3px; padding: 0px 3px&quot;&gt;include_dir!&lt;/span&gt; — the same source serves terminal and website.&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#E5E5E0;align=left;spacingLeft=10;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=6;fontColor=#1C1C1C;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Merriweather Sans;fontSource=https%3A%2F%2Ffonts.googleapis.com%2Fcss%3Ffamily%3DMerriweather%2BSans%3A300%2C400%2C700;" parent="F" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="14" y="206" width="362" height="86" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="F4" value="&lt;b&gt;nxs-test-support&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#6B6B6B&quot;&gt;the gates with teeth: CLI ↔ engine verb parity, binary freshness against the stale-binary trap.&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#E5E5E0;align=left;spacingLeft=10;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=6;fontColor=#1C1C1C;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Merriweather Sans;fontSource=https%3A%2F%2Ffonts.googleapis.com%2Fcss%3Ffamily%3DMerriweather%2BSans%3A300%2C400%2C700;" parent="F" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="14" y="304" width="362" height="76" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="F5" value="&lt;b&gt;xtask&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#6B6B6B&quot;&gt;docs · changelog · version · platforms · channels — the drift gates on generated content.&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#E5E5E0;align=left;spacingLeft=10;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=6;fontColor=#1C1C1C;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Merriweather Sans;fontSource=https%3A%2F%2Ffonts.googleapis.com%2Fcss%3Ffamily%3DMerriweather%2BSans%3A300%2C400%2C700;" parent="F" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="14" y="392" width="362" height="70" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="F6" value="&lt;b&gt;content/&lt;/b&gt; → nxsflow.com&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#6B6B6B&quot;&gt;the same guides become the docs site. &lt;b&gt;Rendering and sanitizing happen in another repo&lt;/b&gt; (nxsflow-landing-page).&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#E5E5E0;align=left;spacingLeft=10;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=6;fontColor=#1C1C1C;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Merriweather Sans;fontSource=https%3A%2F%2Ffonts.googleapis.com%2Fcss%3Ffamily%3DMerriweather%2BSans%3A300%2C400%2C700;" parent="F" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="14" y="474" width="362" height="80" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="F7" value="&lt;b&gt;plugin-probe&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#6B6B6B&quot;&gt;proof that a plugin from a FOREIGN crate arrives linked — the seam for proprietary consumer plugins.&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#E5E5E0;align=left;spacingLeft=10;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=6;fontColor=#1C1C1C;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Merriweather Sans;fontSource=https%3A%2F%2Ffonts.googleapis.com%2Fcss%3Ffamily%3DMerriweather%2BSans%3A300%2C400%2C700;" parent="F" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="14" y="566" width="362" height="80" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="L" value="&lt;b&gt;Reading the colour&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#6B6B6B&quot;&gt;Lime marks the &lt;b&gt;library seam and the log beneath it&lt;/b&gt; — the parts an app touches and the CLI never owns. Everything else is neutral on purpose.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;To build on&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#6B6B6B&quot;&gt;First pass, deliberately coarse. What is &lt;b&gt;not&lt;/b&gt; here:&lt;br&gt;· auth / tenancy at the relay (today there is &lt;b&gt;no&lt;/b&gt; client auth — 6j6v.6aza)&lt;br&gt;· the path of a single op (a sequence view, not a building-block view)&lt;br&gt;· prefix registry and remap-on-join&lt;br&gt;· the role / channel workflow in nxc (worth its own picture)&lt;br&gt;· the release and delivery pipeline&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;The cross-cutting column deliberately has &lt;b&gt;no edges&lt;/b&gt; — it touches every band.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Brand:&lt;/b&gt; nxsflow parent — Merriweather / Merriweather Sans, graphite on white, borders &lt;span style=&quot;font-family: JetBrains Mono, monospace; background-color: #F5FFE6; color: #1C1C1C; border-radius: 3px; padding: 0px 3px&quot;&gt;#E5E5E0&lt;/span&gt;, lime &lt;span style=&quot;font-family: JetBrains Mono, monospace; background-color: #F5FFE6; color: #1C1C1C; border-radius: 3px; padding: 0px 3px&quot;&gt;#B9FF66&lt;/span&gt; / &lt;span style=&quot;font-family: JetBrains Mono, monospace; background-color: #F5FFE6; color: #1C1C1C; border-radius: 3px; padding: 0px 3px&quot;&gt;#84CC16&lt;/span&gt; / wash &lt;span style=&quot;font-family: JetBrains Mono, monospace; background-color: #F5FFE6; color: #1C1C1C; border-radius: 3px; padding: 0px 3px&quot;&gt;#F5FFE6&lt;/span&gt;.&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#E5E5E0;align=left;spacingLeft=12;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=8;fontColor=#1C1C1C;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Merriweather Sans;fontSource=https%3A%2F%2Ffonts.googleapis.com%2Fcss%3Ffamily%3DMerriweather%2BSans%3A300%2C400%2C700;" parent="1" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="1350" y="780" width="390" height="326" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
